# CML Launcher - Proje Hafızası

## Genel Bakış
- **Proje:** Minecraft Launcher (Electron + React + TypeScript + Tailwind v4)
- **Proje Kökü:** `C:\Users\Windows\Downloads\Mc-launcher\`
- **Ortam:** Node v24.13.0, npm 11.6.2, .NET SDK 10.0.302
- **Build:** `npm run build` (main + renderer), `npm run typecheck` (temiz)
- **Çalıştırma:** `npx electron .`

## Mimari
- Electron 34 + React 19 + Vite 6 + Tailwind v4
- electron-log (log), discord-rpc (Discord), electron-builder (paketcilik)
- Doğrulanmış API'ler: Mojang manifest (904 sürüm, latest 26.2), Adoptium, Discord RPC, CurseForge (`$2a$10$bL4bIL5pUWqfcO7KQtnMReakwtfHbNKh6v1uTpKlzhwoueEJQnPnm`), Modrinth, Minecraft.net news
- Microsoft OAuth PKCE: `DEFAULT_CLIENT_ID = "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"`, redirect `http://localhost/callback`

## Tema & UI
- Glass-morphism center card, warm orange/brown (`#c87b3a` accent, `#1a1612` surface)
- Blurred Minecraft background, frost particles
- 22 tab: play, servers, server-create, resource-packs, shader-packs, mods, mod-downloader, mod-loaders, modpacks, screenshots, worlds, profiles, skins, news, server-browser, playtime, game-stats, favorites, crash-logs, updates, settings

## Tamamlanan Servisler (src/main/services/)
- `DownloadService.ts` — 8 eşzamanlılık, retry, SHA1 checksum
- `VersionManager.ts` — Manifest cache, inheritsFrom, natives, virtual assets
- `JavaService.ts` — Registry/PATH + Adoptium kurulumu
- `LaunchManager.ts` — NETWORK_JVM_ARGS, classpath, natives extract, spawn
- `AuthService.ts` — Microsoft PKCE + XBL/XSTS/MC token
- `SettingsService.ts` — autoStart, forceUpdate, customJvmArgs
- `DiscordService.ts` — RPC connect, setActivity, clearActivity
- `ServerListService.ts` — CRUD, ping
- `ModManagerService.ts` — startLocalServer (server.properties, eula, spawn)
- `ProfileManagerService.ts` — CRUD + active profile
- `UpdateService.ts` — GitHub API'den changelog + releaseDate ile güncelleme kontrolü
- `OnlineServices.ts` — listModLoaders, installModLoader, searchMods, installMod, searchModpacks, installModpack (zip extract), listFavoriteServers, addFavoriteServer, removeFavoriteServer, getGameStats (bar chart data), getNews, getPopularServers, getPlayTime/recordPlayStart/End, analyzeCrashLog, getSkin

## IPC & Preload
- `ipc.ts` — 70+ handler (tüm servisler + modpacks, favorites, game-stats)
- `preload.ts` — Tüm API method'ları contextBridge ile
- `index.ts` — Frameless 1180x760, render-process-gone, did-finish-load log
- `logger.ts` — electron-log (file + console)

## UI Bileşenleri (src/renderer/components/)
- Mevcut: TitleBar, CenterCard, DiscordMembers, ServerListPanel, ServerCreatePanel, ResourcePackPanel, ShaderPackPanel, ModManagerPanel, ScreenshotGallery, WorldManager, ProfileManager, SettingsPanel, LogPanel, ProgressBar
- 1. dalgadakiler: ModLoaderInstaller, ModDownloader, SkinManager, NewsFeed, ServerBrowser, PlayTimeStats, CrashLogAnalyzer
- 2. dalgadakiler: ModpackManager, FavoriteServers, GameStatsPanel, LauncherUpdatePanel, QuickPlay

## Bilinen Sorunlar
- Discord RPC: "connection closed" hatası (Discord çalışmıyorsa normal)
- `searchMods` API'si tipinde `mcVersion` yok ama OnlineServices implementation'ında var — preload/ipc sadece query+source geçiriyor

## Sonraki Adımlar (Potansiyel)
- Skin yükleme/değiştirme (sadece şu an sadece gösterme var)
- JVM args editörünü daha gelişmiş hale getirme (preset'ler)
- Daha fazla popüler sunucu ekleme
- Mod sürükle-bırak desteği
- Multiplayer arkadaş listesi
- Otomatik güncelleme mekanizması (indir + kur)
